{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a pure logic-based Metroidvania-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in the game is solved entirely through logical reasoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is click on cells and use deduction to complete a wide variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 puzzle types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 40 unique handcrafted puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A detailed note system to help your reasoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No language support required \u2014 accessible to players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 tracks of relaxing and atmospheric music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A minimalist hand-drawn art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062610?t=1760326990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062610?t=1760326990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062610/53bfb5584d4d5bb73966bed57d9265ac16bdcf13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760326990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062610/53bfb5584d4d5bb73966bed57d9265ac16bdcf13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760326990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a pure logic-based Metroidvania-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in the game is solved entirely through logical reasoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is click on cells and use deduction to complete a wide variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 puzzle types</p><p class